### Proposed domain scores

The platform proposes each domain score from the share of applicable checklist controls the auditor confirmed with evidence, then lowers it by 1 for each open High or Critical finding in that domain (minimum 1). The Lead Auditor sets the final score and records a rationale when it differs from the proposal by more than 1.

